he undated file. The dated 商业模式 file already exists (from previous round), but the task wants the undated base file rewritten and aligned. Per AGENTS.md rules: \"Preserve existing report files unless the task specifically asks to change them.\" — The task specifically asks to change this one. OK.\n\nSo what should the rewritten file conclude? \"同一只股票的同一次重研，四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点。\"\n\nLet me determine the \"一致\" conclusions from the three latest reports:\n\n- 巴菲特 (08-11): 内在涨幅 +11%, 击球区 🟡, 建仓 35, 补仓 30\n- 芒格 (08-19): no 量化结论, defers. Notes 34.63 已进入\"35元以下舒适击球区\"\n- 李录 (08-19): 内在涨幅 −9.7%, 击球区 🔴, 建仓 30, 补仓 27\n\nHmm. There's a genuine conflict between 巴菲特/旧段永平 (🟡, 建仓 34-35, 补仓 30) and 李录 08-19 (🔴, 建仓 30, 补仓 27).\n\nThe dated reports (08-19) are the newest. 李录 08-19 gives 🔴/30/27. 芒格 08-19 says price has entered the previously-set 35以下 comfortable zone (🟡-ish) but defers pricing authority.\n\nSo the \"同一次重研\" — which round is this? The latest round is 08-19 (第二轮). In that round:\n- 芒格: 行业改善, 价格进入上轮击球区 (35以下), but defers\n- 李录: 🔴 未到, 建仓 30, 补仓 27\n- 段永平 (dated, from previous run of this same task): 🟡 接近上沿, 建仓 34 (含息)/33.45 (除息), 补仓 30 (from 上轮)\n\nHmm wait — actually the dated 段永平 file was created Aug 19 15:14, the 芒格 dated Aug 19 15:15, 李录 dated Aug 19 15:15. So they were all created in the same previous session/round at 15:14-15:15. That was likely a previous attempt at this same task! The previous run generated dated files for 芒格/李录/段永平 (all three have -20260819), but apparently the task-runner (me, in a new session) is now asked to rewrite the undated 段永平 base file.\n\nActually wait. Let me reconsider. Maybe the previous session ran the full investment-team round 2, producing dated files for all four perspectives... but there's no dated 巴菲特 file. And the current task asks: read the three (巴菲特 undated, 芒格 dated, 李录 dated), rewrite undated 段永平.\n\nHmm, but the current task says \"读旧文件 reports/002415海康威视-商业模式-段永平视角.md（商业模式 视角，内容已过时）\" — treating the undated 段永平 file as outdated and to be rewritten. It doesn't mention the dated 段永平 file at all.\n\nI think the intent: The undated 段永平 base file should be brought up to date (aligned with the latest conclusions from the other three perspectives' latest reports). The dated 段永平 file (second round) can remain untouched.\n\nBut what alignment? The task says: \"同一只股票的同一次重研，四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点\"\n\nThe three latest reports' conclusions:\n1. 巴菲特 (only version available, 08-11): 🟡 / 建仓35 / 补仓30 / +11%\n2. 芒格 (08-19): no explicit numbers, but notes entry into 35以下 zone\n3. 李录 (08-19): 🔴 / 建仓30 / 补仓27 / −9.7%\n\nThese are NOT consistent with each other. 李录 differs from 巴菲特. So \"一致\" can't mean literally identical across all — it means the 段永平 rewrite should align with the consensus of the latest reports. \n\nGiven the instruction hierarchy, I should think about what the \"team-lead\" synthesis would be. The dated reports are from round 2 (08-19). 李录's round-2 conclusion: 建仓 30, 补仓 27, 🔴, 内在价值 31.2 元. 芒格 round-2: entered 35以下 zone but defers. 巴菲特: no round-2 report exists; his 08-11 report said 建仓 35, 补仓 30, 🟡, +11% (at 37.45 baseline).\n\nHmm, but here's a subtlety: 巴菲特's 建仓价 35 元 was computed at a baseline of 37.45. Now price is 34.54-34.63 (ex-div). 巴菲特's own framework (35 = 中性情景 41.2 × 85%) — the 中性情景 target 41.2 was based on 2025A EPS and 3-year forecast; ex-dividend doesn't change the target much (dividend 0.55 is small relative to 41.2). So 巴菲特's 建仓 35 stands as-is in ex-div terms roughly (or 34.45 ex-div equivalent).\n\nThe old 段永平's 建仓 34.0 含息 → 33.45 除息等效.\n\n李录's 建仓 30/补仓 27 is much more conservative.\n\nSo what should the rewritten undated 段永平 file conclude? The task instruction says the four perspectives should agree \"unless the perspective has a reasoned basis to differ\". The 段永平 perspective is about 商业模式 — his methodology: \"好公司给合理估值即可买入，但制裁灰犀牛与减持压制要求安全边际\". \n\nHmm, let me think about what \"对齐\" means here practically. The task seems to be a re-